  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG_0850.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Casal Jove de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado un taller culinario de elaboraci&oacute;n de batidos de frutas, con el que ha comenzado el curso 2014-15, en el que destaca un curso de conversaci&oacute;n en ingl&eacute;s.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0843.jpg\" alt=\"img_0843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0844.jpg\" alt=\"img_0844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0846.jpg\" alt=\"img_0846\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0847.jpg\" alt=\"img_0847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0849.jpg\" alt=\"img_0849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbatutscasaljove060914/img_0850.jpg\" alt=\"img_0850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
